Third-party software
====================

The source tree contains no third-party source code. The build downloads the
components below (CMake FetchContent) and links them into the programs; a binary
of Tsukuraku therefore contains them. Each keeps its own licence. When you pass
binaries on, pass on these notices and the licence texts of the components
(they are in the downloaded sources, build/_deps/<name>-src).

In the runtime (hml_runtime) and the designer (hml_designer):

  LVGL 9.6.0                 MIT                        https://github.com/lvgl/lvgl
    with the fonts Montserrat (SIL Open Font License 1.1) and
    Font Awesome Free icons (SIL OFL 1.1 for the font, CC BY 4.0 for the icons)
  nlohmann/json 3.11.3       MIT                        https://github.com/nlohmann/json
  Lua 5.4.8                  MIT                        https://www.lua.org
  SQLite 3.50.4              public domain              https://www.sqlite.org
  miniz 3.0.2                MIT                        https://github.com/richgel999/miniz
  Mbed TLS 3.6.4             Apache-2.0 (or GPL-2.0-or-later; used under Apache-2.0)
                                                        https://github.com/Mbed-TLS/mbedtls
  open62541 1.4.22           MPL-2.0                    https://github.com/open62541/open62541
    (linked unchanged; its source is available at the address above)
  SDL 2.32.8                 zlib                       https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL
    (the PC build of the runtime only)

In the designer only:

  webview 0.12.0             MIT                        https://github.com/webview/webview
  Microsoft Edge WebView2    Microsoft's terms (the loader that comes with webview;
                             the WebView2 runtime is part of Windows or installed separately)

In the tests only (not in what is passed on):

  doctest 2.4.11             MIT                        https://github.com/doctest/doctest

